        'teacher_pacing'=>"Launch | 5 minutes | Connect to a familiar situation.\nLearn It | 10 minutes | Model the concept with objects and pictures.\nWorked Example | 7 minutes | Explain why each step works.\nGuided Practice | 12 minutes | Release one step at a time.\nIndependent Practice | 12 minutes | Require a model and an answer.\nMastery | 5 minutes | Check understanding and vocabulary.",
        'teacher_misconceptions'=>"Students act on a keyword instead of the full situation | Have students retell what changes before choosing an operation.\nStudents treat the equal sign as an answer signal | Use true equations in different forms and describe balance.\nStudents calculate correctly but cannot explain | Require a labeled model and a sentence connecting it to the equation.",
        'teacher_differentiation'=>"Beginning | Use concrete objects and smaller numbers.\nDeveloping | Pair objects with a drawing and equation.\nOn Level | Move flexibly among models, equations, and words.\nAdvanced | Compare strategies, create problems, and justify general rules.\nMultilingual Learners | Preteach vocabulary with pictures, gestures, and sentence frames.",
